  "qualification": "Local metadata-only/source-preservation, execution, headless interaction and directly viewed offscreen frames. No native Access interaction, Windows API execution or full QBE/ACE SQL parity claim.",
  "observations": [
    "Ten exact Totals roles lower to owned SELECT/GROUP BY/WHERE/HAVING syntax. Hidden keys retain grouping; Count(field) and explicit Count(*) remain distinct. Criteria shorthand captures actual operand ASTs, with no output alias substitution or lossy cross-phase OR factoring.",
    "Owned PARAMETERS declarations retain name/type spelling/order and source-field precedence. Strict owner-backed header parsing refuses extra statements and duplicate declarations; hosts maintain no second type grammar. Actual MCP returned drafts can be rebuilt without dropping declarations or Totals roles.",
    "Bound import retains canonical projection, joins, aliases, clause ownership, grouping, sorting and declarations. Unsupported conversions preserve literal SQL, draft and prior results. Hidden nongrouped sort keys retain their default nongrouped role; parser limits propagate rather than becoming Text fallback.",
    "Design Run uses the same issued inspection/discovery/typed prompt services as SQL View with captured QueryRunOptions. No view switch or host query semantics are introduced. Matching complete results retain actual Design provenance; stale, cancelled and duplicate requests cannot replace prior rows.",
    "Actual matching Design cancellation revokes a real actor-buffered reply; stale/mismatched IDs and ordinary SQL cannot acquire Design cancellation authority. Source bytes, prior rows and absence of a journal are observed independently.",
    "Unavailable Totals-off transitions are disabled with localized reason and no Click action. A rendering-only revision cache avoids repeated parsing; the consuming guard validates again. Roles/text are not silently reset.",
    "UI retained accounting includes actual owned parameter-name capacity through the SQL Name owner. An actual parsed declaration exceeds the existing retained UI pool without losing draft/mode/results. All eight catalogs pass key/variable/format checks.",
    "Evidenced English SumOf/MinOf/MaxOf defaults apply only to shown plain native-field aggregate roles without explicit aliases. Generated collisions refuse without invented suffixes; explicit aliases/Expression syntax and other runnable role naming are preserved."
  ],
